[136.719027, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m Okay, let’s talk about this Audit skill! Basically, it's checking if the source code for a software package has the correct licenses and copyright information attached to it. This tool looks at all the individual files in the source code and uses AI to automatically create a `debian/copyright` file, which is a really important document for Ubuntu and Debian packages.  Having this file ensures the software is legally usable and avoids potential problems down the road – it’s a key part of making sure our software is built and distributed properly!\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\r\nCalling Agent...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
